  {bio.map((p) => <p>{p}</p>)}
  <p>
    In my free time I'm <img class="hl" src={url("/logos/valorant.svg")} alt="Valorant" width="14" height="14" /> hardstuck <img class="hl" src={url("/logos/ascendant1.png")} alt="Ascendant 1" width="14" height="14" /> Ascendant 1, <img class="hl" src={url("/logos/chessdotcom.svg")} alt="Chess" width="14" height="14" /> playing chess, and rewatching Apothecary Diaries.
